Z||000000||pHoOl||09-19-2000||03:17 PM||||I was going to drive a friend back to his apartment, since he had not been for a ride in my fine automobile as of yet.  So instead, we took a ride through town, all the time looking for a turn that i could take him on. <P> Well, a girl in a camaro came to the four way stop, so i decided to get behind her.  And just to patronize her, i decided to ride her a$$ a little bit.  We end up getting to another four way stop, and she turns down the road which leads back to school, a very long enterance driveway.  As she turned, she reached her hand up (it was a convertable) and waved "bye bye" and then took off.  I waited my turn and decided she wasn't going to get away with it.  I chased her down the street until i hit 80, then decided it was time to back off, cause our police on campus are actually a full blown police department, and love to get donut money by writing tickets.  <P>While i didn't get to line up, or pass her, i felt good about stayin on her tail.  It was an RS, so that's probably why it was no problem.  Probably a 97-2000.  <P>But, it's the first thing that i've had close to a kill, so, i'll count it.  Those other punks in mustangs don't want to race, i cant' imagine why.<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Fearless Freep||09-19-2000||04:32 PM||||Down here in the South they arrest you for that  (stalking)  had a friend who just happened to be going the same way as some woman...he was following a bit close...sure as hell..about 15 minutes late the local yokel pulled him over (she called from a cell phone)||||reg||1
